// P-04 Live Trip Map's Maps API key. Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored — see
// ios/.gitignore) and fill in a real value. Debug.xcconfig and Release.xcconfig include
// Secrets.xcconfig optionally, so a build with no copy made still succeeds: the map just
// renders no tiles (docs/06-development/LOCAL_SETUP.md, CLAUDE.md §7 — never commit a key).
MAPS_API_KEY=
